장면 AppleEvidenceFixture
  EvidencePolicy apple_evidence: version 2, domain Synthetic protocol demonstration for the apple grading task. This is not a scientific source review., inclusion Admit the exact task reference for intent and clearly labeled authored source fixtures solely to exercise evidence processing., exclusion Exclude text outside the declared task conditions and do not treat synthetic sources as scientific publications., query_plan Record both supportive and opposing search intentions. This offline fixture executes no search., cutoff Fixture snapshot 2026-11-12. No claim of a current literature cutoff., max_sources 8, min_independent 1, max_context_bytes 65536
  Claim red_expectation: criterion intent, statement The fixed task expects a red appearance for its specified specimen., conditions The exact specimen and viewing conditions in the grading contract., kind established
  Claim optical_basis: criterion principle, statement Apparent surface color depends jointly on illumination and wavelength selective surface response and the observer., conditions An ordinary visible surface observed under the stated illumination and observer conditions., kind established
  Claim conclusion_link: criterion reasoning, statement For the fixed red specimen under broad white illumination the described selective surface response supports the red conclusion., conditions Do not substitute a different specimen or illumination for the fixed present task., kind established
